        "label": "主流程：網址擷取至直連秒回",
        "focus": ["user_input", "batch_scheduler", "rust_ipc", "sidecar_bridge", "javdb_scraper", "handle_mgr", "rd_triage", "rd_client", "cache_judge", "unrestrict_out"],
        "note": "追蹤使用者貼上網址，經過 TLS 爬蟲、Handle 抽象、RD 智慧選檔與快取秒回生成直連的完整路徑。"
      },
      {
        "id": "pending-retry",
        "label": "未快取佇列與重試閉環",
